    "source_text": "Purpose: read-only Git status for one authorized repository. Input: project_root:string, include_untracked?:boolean. Output: branch/head, staged/unstaged/untracked summary and explicit paths. Contract: L2 read_only; scope mac.git.read; target project_root; timeout 10000ms; cap 256KiB; network none; filesystem read_allowed_project; redaction applies; approval trusted_read; idempotent yes. Phase 3 planned."
